    "ref-annex-iii": {
      "answer": "Annex III of the AI Act lists high-risk AI systems, including those used for law enforcement, border management, justice, and democracy, as well as systems covered under points 6, 7, and 8 [2]. It also includes systems that require registration by deployers before being put into service [3].",
