    "ref-article-50": {
      "answer": "Article 50 of the AI Act requires providers and deployers of certain AI systems to ensure transparency, such as informing natural persons about interactions with AI systems, marking AI-generated content in a machine-readable format, and disclosing the artificial generation or manipulation of content [1, 2, 3, 5].",
