    "ref-article-83": {
      "answer": "Article 83 sets out the general conditions for imposing administrative fines, including that they must be effective, proportionate, and dissuasive [6]. It outlines factors considered when determining the fine, such as the nature and gravity of the infringement, the controller's responsibility, and cooperation with supervisory authorities [7]. Fines can reach up to 20 million EUR or 4% of annual turnover for certain violations [10].",
      "cited": [
