  "notes": {
    "20261030-083348-checklist-for-deployers-under-article-26": {
      "sources": [
        "bba630444b3278e8:323",
        "bba630444b3278e8:332",
        "bba630444b3278e8:327",
        "bba630444b3278e8:328"
      ],
      "content": "1. Take appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure systems are used in accordance with instructions for use [1]. 2. Request authorisation from a judicial or administrative authority for post-remote biometric identification systems, if applicable [2]. 3. Monitor the operation of the high-risk AI system based on the instructions for use and inform providers and authorities if risks are identified [3]. 4. Keep logs of the system's operation for at least six months, unless otherwise required by law [4]. 5. Ensure that the system is not used for untargeted law enforcement purposes without a link to a criminal offence [2]."
    },
    "20261030-083359-obowiazki-administratora-z-art-33-rodo": {
      "sources": [
        "61bddbf0f0749097:262",
        "61bddbf0f0749097:260",
        "61bddbf0f0749097:222",
        "61bddbf0f0749097:280"
      ],
      "content": "1. Zgłaszanie naruszeń ochrony danych osobowych do organu nadzorczego [1]. \n2. Opis naruszenia, w tym kategorie danych i liczba osób oraz wpisów danych [2]. \n3. Podanie danych kontaktowych inspektora ochrony danych [2]. \n4. Opis konsekwencji naruszenia [2]. \n5. Opis środków zaradczych w celu zaradzenia naruszeniu [2]. \n6. Dokumentacja naruszeń, w tym okoliczności, skutki i działania zaradcze [1]. \n7. Wdrażanie środków technicznych i organizacyjnych do przestrzegania RODO [3]. \n8. Konsultacje z organem nadzorczym, w tym dane kontaktowe inspektora [4]. \n9. Ocena skutków dla ochrony danych [4]."
    },
    "20261030-083409-contoso": {
      "sources": [
        "a3f6e11d24f26381:1",
        "a3f6e11d24f26381:3"
      ],
      "content": "The Contoso helpdesk replies to every ticket within 8 working hours. [1] Urgent tickets get a reply within 1 hour. [1]\n\nTickets without a reply after two working days go to the support manager. [2]"
    }
  },
